---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { person } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms for using this portfolio site and the work shown on it."
  updated="9 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    By using this site you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site. Questions are welcome at{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${person.email}`}>{person.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What the site is for</h2>
  <p>
    This is the personal portfolio of {person.name}. It shows my work and how I approach product design, so that people
    can decide whether to work with me. It is not a shop and offers no services online.
  </p>

  <h2>Ownership of the content</h2>
  <p>
    The site design, texts, illustrations and case studies are mine unless stated otherwise. You may share links to any
    page. Please do not copy, republish or reuse the content, images or case studies without my written permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Client work and NDAs</h2>
  <p>
    Some projects are covered by non-disclosure agreements. In those case studies I hide or change client names, people,
    data and screens. Product names, logos and trademarks of other companies belong to their owners, and showing them
    here does not mean those companies endorse me.
  </p>

  <h2>Claude skills on GitHub</h2>
  <p>
    The Claude skills I link to are published on GitHub. Their use is governed by the terms in that repository, not by
    this page.
  </p>

  <h2>Accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    I describe my work and its results as accurately as I can.
    The site is provided as it is, without any warranty, and may change at any time.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to other services such as LinkedIn, Behance, Dribbble and GitHub. I am not responsible for their
    content or their terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent the law allows, I am not liable for any loss that comes from using this site or relying on its
    content.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Ukraine.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>I may update these terms. The date at the top shows the latest version.</p>
</LegalPage>
